    "protocol": "One fresh page per case and two independent CanvasRenderer instances from the pinned upstream archive (headless Chromium, --use-angle=metal). loadManifest, loadEffects, compile the recorded DSL, apply the demo ProgramState step values, upload a transparent canvas to every media step, render one frame at the case time, and read global_o0_write twice as top-down RGBA8. Both reads of both instances are byte-identical for every case."
